1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,780
二十一个键，半把键盘。
Twenty-one keys. Half a keyboard.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,060
拆开，是六层。
Take it apart: six layers.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:11,831
每一层，都画在公开的文件里。
Every one of them is drawn in open files.

4
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:18,460
一颗 RP2040 芯片，管着全部。
One RP2040 chip runs it all.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,949
二十三颗灯珠，反着贴在背面。
Twenty-three lights, mounted upside down.

6
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:25,066
热插拔，不用焊接。
Hot-swappable. No soldering.

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,550
装回去。
Put it back together.

8
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:31,010
键距 19.05 毫米。
19.05 millimetres apart.

9
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:33,366
每一个数字，都是公开的。
Every number is public.
